Plain copies of loose dotfiles from ~ (not ~/.config): .p10k.zsh, .gtkrc-2.0,
.aliases. See the parent rice/README for details. Not managed or symlinked by
Home Manager -- editing a file here does nothing to your live config.

Pictures/Wallpapers/ -- full copy of ~/Pictures/Wallpapers (2226 files, ~3.7G),
the wallpaper pool matugen/hyprpaper pick from. Large and tracked in git
knowingly (repo is public); this is the one folder in rice/ that's about
storage, not documentation.

fastfetch-custom/ -- the two source images for the fastfetch logo (~/fastfetch-custom):
arch-ultron.png (used by ~/.config/fastfetch/make-ultron-logo.sh to build the
theme-following logo) and arch-toji.png (the earlier blue logo style). See
config/fastfetch/README for how they are used.
